    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please select and launch this DLC from the launch options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orthodox dungeon strategy RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore each dungeon and defeat bosses to proceed to the next dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u30fbPlayable quickly with cheat equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u30fbCheat equipment can be used to defeat the last boss and EX and some enemies cannot be defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u30fbThere are many challenging elements: collector items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u30fbHundreds of hidden items (tiny medal system)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u30fbStages with the same music for dungeon and battle appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Treasure chests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are treasure chests that can be revived again by going back and forth in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a low probability of finding rare items in those treasure chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of this game is a \u201cgame of matching answers\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, you need to put in a specific character to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't have the protection skill and weakness corresponding to the boss, you can't beat it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't beat it. (Exceptions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters every time and put in the right skills for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to put in a character that has the right skills for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please select and launch this DLC from the launch options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orthodox dungeon strategy RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore each dungeon and defeat bosses to proceed to the next dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u30fbPlayable quickly with cheat equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u30fbCheat equipment can be used to defeat the last boss and EX and some enemies cannot be defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u30fbThere are many challenging elements: collector items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u30fbHundreds of hidden items (tiny medal system)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u30fbStages with the same music for dungeon and battle appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Treasure chests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are treasure chests that can be revived again by going back and forth in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a low probability of finding rare items in those treasure chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of this game is a \u201cgame of matching answers\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, you need to put in a specific character to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't have the protection skill and weakness corresponding to the boss, you can't beat it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't beat it. (Exceptions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters every time and put in the right skills for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to put in a character that has the right skills for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
